{"ref":"BDB, רְמִיָּה²","hw":"רְמִיָּה²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְמִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. laxness, slackness</strong>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">כַּף ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.4\">Pr 10:4</a> <em>slack</em> (negligent, idle) <em>hand</em> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַד חָרוּצִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> alone = <em>slackness</em> (abstr. for concr. = one who is slack) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.24\">12:24</a> (‖ id.), v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.27\">27</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חרך\" href=\"/BDB,_חרך\", dir=\"rtl\">חרך</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.15\">19:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עַצְלָה</span>); as adv. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁה מְלֶאכֶת י׳ רְמִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.10\">Je 48:10</a>.","next":"BDB, יִרְמְיָ֫ה(וּ)","prev":"BDB, רמה"}